-- section 4.12 debug-leak: forgotten-free lint (DBG-05)
-- @req: DBG-05
-- @expected-pass-after: phase-31
-- A non-escaping heap binding that is never freed, never leaked, and never
-- defer-freed must raise the W0606 forgotten-free warning (best-effort lint,
-- NOT a hard error). The W0606 contract is pinned by the dedicated ctest row
-- (v4_4.12-debug-leak_forgotten_free: ironc check | grep W0606). The aggregate
-- run-and-compare handler cannot observe compile-time warnings, so .expected
-- pins the runtime stdout (warning-only: the program still builds and runs).

object Point {
    val x: Int
    val y: Int
}

func main() {
    val p = heap Point(1, 2)
    println("x: {p.x}")
}
